+ *	11:10 	M 	Read/write 	Operating mode :
+ *				00 : Free running timer mode(default) 	01 : Periodic timer mode. 	 
+ *				10 : Free running counter mode. 		11 : Periodic counter mode. 	 
+ *	9:8 	ES 	Read/write 	External input active edge selection. 
